    <string name="install_guide_intro">Android Auto blocks template (video surface) apps unless they are installed with Google Play as the installer package. Unknown sources does not fix this.</string>
    <string name="install_guide_windows_steps">Windows steps: enable USB debugging, connect phone, run platform-tools adb. Uninstall ipanHub first. From the folder containing cartube-debug.apk run the command below. Full guide: docs/VIDEO_ON_CAR.md in the repo.</string>
    <string name="install_guide_shizuku_note">No PC? Use Shizuku plus UnknownAuto on the phone (GitHub) to install with Play attribution. Root not required on most devices.</string>
    <string name="install_guide_after_install">After reinstall: Android Auto developer Unknown sources ON, Customize launcher, pick ipanHub under apps/navigation (not Media only).</string>
